Package: xrobotoolkit-pc-service
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: roboticsservice.support@bytedance.com
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6 (>= 9), libgcc-s1 (>= 4), libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libglib2.0-0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://business-cn.picoxr.com/
Description: XRoboToolkit PC Service (headless, service only)
 Provides the headless gRPC service process for XRoboToolkit / PICO robotics
 PC-side integration. This package contains only RoboticsServiceProcess and
 the Qt / gRPC runtime libraries required to run it. No GUI demos, no QML.
